cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Intent and Evidence Project Engine"
abstract: >-
  A project-agnostic engine for documentation-first, ticket-first, evidence-qualified
  software engineering with autonomous agents. Intent governs implementation; issues
  bound authority; promotion requires declared empirical evidence. The reference
  implementation provides protocol specifications, JSON schemas, coordinator
  semantics, validation tooling, and adoption profiles.
type: software
authors:
